    "description": "# napari-aibirthday\n\nAI birthday video generator from a single photo: they pop champagne on a park bench, blow out a Scorpio cake, or light a crown cake at the car window.\n\nOfficial napari plugin for [AI Birthday Video Generator](https://aibirthdayvideogenerator.com/?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=package) (`https://aibirthdayvideogenerator.com/`). Generate 12-second 720p vertical (`9:16`) birthday video clips on `seedance-2-mini` and open the decoded frame stack directly as a napari image layer.\n\n- Create an API key at [API Keys](https://aibirthdayvideogenerator.com/settings/apikeys) and set `ABVG_API_KEY`.\n- Scene guides: [Read the Docs](https://aibirthdayvideogenerator.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) \u00b7 Credit packs: [Pricing](https://aibirthdayvideogenerator.com/pricing?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=package).\n- Source code: [github.com/hanshs474/napari-aibirthday](https://github.com/hanshs474/napari-aibirthday).\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\npip install napari-aibirthday\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen **Plugins \u2192 AI Birthday Video Generator** in napari, paste your prompt and optional portrait URL, and click **Generate Birthday Video**.\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
